<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LA RETAIL AGREES TO BUY CLOTHING FIRM.</title>
<headline>LA RETAIL AGREES TO BUY CLOTHING FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>LA Retail Stores Ltd said on Thursday it had reached agreement in principle to buy the business of Skye, a distributor of branded apparel and footwear to the retail industry.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to continue to exercise caution when dealing in the firm's shares and said further details of the buy would e made on April 2.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
